diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 835cfa3..1a34f17 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,19 @@
 
 All notable, unreleased changes to this project will be documented in this file. For the released changes, please visit the [Releases](https://github.com/saleor/saleor/releases) page.
 
+# Next
+
+### GraphQL API
+
+- Added optional plain-text `storageConditions` field to the `Product`, `ProductTranslation` and `ProductTranslatableContent` types. It is accepted by `ProductInput` (`productCreate`, `productUpdate`, `productBulkCreate`) and by `TranslationInput` (`productTranslate`, `productBulkTranslate`). Values are limited to 250 characters; longer values are rejected with `INVALID` on the `storageConditions` field. Empty values are allowed.
+- `collectionTranslate` and `categoryTranslate` reject `storageConditions` with `INVALID`, because only products have storage conditions. They share `TranslationInput` with `productTranslate`, so the field is visible in their schema.
+- Bulk translation mutations (`productBulkTranslate`, `productVariantBulkTranslate`, `attributeBulkTranslate`, `attributeValueBulkTranslate`) return `INVALID` for values that are too long, instead of a GraphQL error.
+- Added `STORAGE_CONDITIONS` to `ProductFieldEnum`, which adds a `storage conditions` column to the product CSV export.
+
+### Webhooks
+
+- Product webhook payloads include the `storage_conditions` field.
+
 # 3.23.0
 
 ### Breaking changes
